274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 676 0 R
/ActualText (Arrive at Bagdogra Airport at 10:00 AM, where you will be greeted by your trip mates and trip leader. After warm introductions, you will embark on a journey to Phuentsholing, the second-largest town in Bhutan, renowned for its perfect blend of urban charm and natural beauty. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 677 0 R
/ActualText (Upon arrival in Phuentsholing, you will check in at a carefully selected partner hotel, ensuring a comfortable and welcoming stay. After settling in, enjoy a delightful and hearty dinner with your new friends, creating the perfect opportunity to bond and share the excitement for the days ahead. Spend the night in the comfort of your hotel, resting up for the adventures to come.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
