/P 683 0 R
/ActualText (Begin your day with a hearty breakfast at the hotel, preparing yourself for an exciting day of exploration in Thimphu.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 684 0 R
/ActualText (Start your sightseeing with a visit to the iconic Buddha Dordenma Statue, also known as the Buddha Viewpoint. This magnificent statue offers panoramic views of the Thimphu valley and is a significant cultural landmark. Next, head to the Simply Bhutan Living Museum, where you can immerse yourself in Bhutanese culture, traditions, and way of life through interactive exhibits.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 685 0 R
/ActualText (Continue to the Sangay Gang Viewpoint, which provides breathtaking vistas of the surrounding landscapes. Afterward, explore the vibrant Handicraft Market, where you can find a variety of traditional Bhutanese crafts and souvenirs.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 686 0 R
/ActualText (Return to your hotel by evening. The rest of the evening is at your leisure. We recommend experiencing Thimphu's eclectic nightlife, which offers a range of entertainment options. Conclude your day with a relaxing night at your hotel in Thimphu, ready for the adventures ahead.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
