307 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 688 0 R
/ActualText (Begin your adventure with a hike to Chimi Lhakhang, the Temple of Fertility. Perched on a round hillock, this sacred site offers stunning views of the Punakha Valley. It's not only a place of spiritual significance but also a vantage point for appreciating the valley's natural beauty.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
