<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 690 0 R
/ActualText (If time permits, consider adding an adventurous touch to your day with river rafting in Punakha. This activity is available at an additional cost and promises an exhilarating experience on the river's rapids.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
