330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 697 0 R
/ActualText (After enjoying a filling breakfast at the hotel, embark on a rewarding hike to the renowned Tiger's Nest Temple \(Paro Taktsang\). Perched precariously on a cliffside, this iconic monastery is situated 900 metres above the valley floor, offering stunning panoramic views and a profound spiritual experience.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
331 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 698 0 R
/ActualText (If time allows, treat yourself to a traditional Bhutanese Hot Stone Bath session. This unique experience involves immersing yourself in a bath where hot stones are used to heat the water, infused with Menchu \(medicinal water\), providing relaxation and therapeutic benefits.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
